		{
			title: "Welcome to Tier 6!"
			icon: {
				id: "botania:cosmetic_questgiver_mark"
				Count: 1b
				tag: { }
			}
			x: -11.25d
			y: -1.5d
			description: [
				"Congratulations on making it this far! Reaching Tier 6 means you have already overcome countless challenges, built enormous production chains and mastered technologies that once seemed impossible."
				""
				"You have also completed your endgame rocket. Now it is finally time to put it to use."
				""
				"Tier 6 is a special endgame chapter and follows a different structure from the tiers before it. Your journey will take you to the most distant and dangerous planets, where rare materials, extreme environments and the final stages of space progression await."
				""
				"You will also begin working with Creative Items and Machines; some of the most powerful and demanding constructions in the entire modpack. These items and machines represent the peak of production and require resources gathered from across your entire journey."
				""
				"Be prepared to consume huge amounts of high-quality Boosting Mixture throughout this chapter. Tier 6 is intentionally grindy and will be no walk in the park. Proper production setups, reliable automation and large material reserves will be essential if you want to keep progressing efficiently."
				""
				"Your rocket is ready. Now discover where it can take you."
			]
			dependencies: ["02F7B331144D6D20"]
			hide: true
			size: 3.0d
			id: "1DF1FC5857617717"
			tasks: [{
				id: "68AEBABABFA75E30"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			rewards: [{
				id: "72AFB813AE3E6C71"
				type: "item"
				item: "kubejs:coin_t1"
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "Destination: Venus"
			icon: "aoa3:lelyetia_portal"
			x: -6.5d
			y: -1.5d
			description: [
				"Your next destination is Venus."
				""
				"This hostile planet is overflowing with valuable ores and resource blocks, including Allthemodium, Cobalt, Eezo, Emberstone, Obsidiorite, Palladium, Opal, Red Gemstones and Vibranium. These materials generate here in very generous amounts, making Venus one of the most important mining locations in the entire chapter."
				""
				"Vibranium will be especially important throughout Tier 6, so gathering a large supply early is highly recommended. The other resources will also be extremely useful for upcoming machines, recipes and progression."
				""
				"Prepare enough storage, bring reliable mining equipment and make the most of the planet’s unusually rich deposits. Also, do not forget to collect some Venus Sand before leaving... it will be needed for our final materia."
				""
				"Venus may be dangerous, but its resources are worth the journey."
			]
			dependencies: ["1DF1FC5857617717"]
			hide: true
			id: "07211BE85DFDA8EC"
