		{
			title: "Divide and Conquer"
			icon: {
				id: "botania:cosmetic_questgiver_mark"
				Count: 1b
				tag: { }
			}
			x: -3.5d
			y: -1.5d
			description: [
				"Now that Vibranium is within your reach, it is time to divide your work into several different areas."
				""
				"There are many preparations, production chains and intermediate steps ahead before the Tier 6 machines can be completed. Working through these branches in parallel will help you reach them as “quickly” as endgame progression allows."
				""
				"Each area will focus on a different part of the process, but all of them will eventually come together. Expand your automation, prepare the required materials and keep every production line running—you are going to need all of it."
				""
				"The foundations are ready. Now split the workload, master every branch and prepare to conquer the world."
			]
			dependencies: ["07211BE85DFDA8EC"]
			hide: true
			id: "3BA4D4D6F0118B9C"
