		{
			title: "********************* Congratulations! *********************"
			icon: "ftbquests:barrier"
			x: 88.25d
			y: 0.75d
			description: [
				"If you have truly made it this far, crafted one of the Creative-tier recipes, and unlocked the final quest of the entire main questline, then I have to take my hat off to you."
				""
				"What you have accomplished to get here is honestly incredible. There were moments during the development of DDSS2 where even I almost lost my mind, so I can only imagine what you had to go through while actually playing it :D"
				""
				"I sincerely hope that you had many enjoyable hours along the way, and that I managed to put a smile on your face from time to time... and perhaps also make you cry every now and then. That was probably part of the experience. ^^"
				""
				"Since this will very likely be the last modpack I ever create, this moment means quite a lot to me. I’m getting a little older myself, and over the years I’ve slowly grown away from Minecraft. Because of that, I want to take this opportunity to personally thank you for your support."
				""
				"Whether you were a quiet player who simply enjoyed the pack, an active member of our Discord community, someone who helped report bugs and improve the pack, or even one of my Patrons:"
				""
				"Thank you for everything!"
				""
				"I will never forget the journey that DDSS1 + DDSS2 became, and I hope that at least a small part of it will remain in your memories as well."
				""
				"And of course, one final and enormous thank you to the entire community. ❤ So many people contributed in one way or another and helped turn this pack into what it is today. Without all of that feedback, testing, support, patience, and enthusiasm, DDSS2 would never have become the pack you just completed."
				""
				"Wherever life takes you from here, I wish you nothing but the very best, my friend."
				""
				"Thank you for playing."
				""
				"With the highest respect,"
				"Freebi — Geronimo Peers"
			]
