			description: [
				"The Draconic Capacitor is a modular Curio item from Draconic Evolution. By itself, it does nothing you must install Energy Modules before it can function at all. Once powered up, it becomes a powerful portable energy component for your late-game setup. Press Shift + C to open the module configuration and customize it to your needs."
